# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if having platform-specific dependencies or dependencies
#   having no cross-platform support, pipenv may install different versions of dependencies
#   our Pipfile Locks dependencies to specific hash, using different hashes for different platforms.
#   Also Pipfile.lock differs multiple times in the same project. Example:
#   https://github.com/pypa/pipenv/issues/1995#issuecomment-374646166
# Pipfile.lock

# PEP 582; used by PDM, PEP 582 proposal
